        "whose buried chest is said to be guarded by a family of crabs",
        "where a jewelled cutlass is buried beneath the old well",
        "with a hoard of pearls hidden in a hollow tree",
        "where the gold is buried under the only patch of shade",
        "where every palm tree has a different clue carved into its trunk",
        "whose treasure has been hunted by fifty crews and found by none",
        "where a sea chest full of emeralds sits beneath the low-tide mark",
        "with a cave of silver ingots behind a waterfall",
        "where the map only makes sense if you read it upside down",
        "whose hoard includes a golden parrot with ruby eyes",
        "where gold from a sunken galleon washes into the rock pools after every storm",
        "with a riddle carved into the cliff that points the way to the gold",
        "where an iron chest of coins is chained to a rock beneath the tide",
