        "with a chest of jewels hidden inside a sunken rowing boat",
        "where a captain hid her fortune in a barrel of salted fish",
        "whose buried treasure is marked by a single silver spoon stuck in the sand",
        "where a trail of gold coins leads from the beach into the jungle",
        "where the treasure is buried under the cook's old vegetable patch"
